emma":"செகு","gloss":"slaying"}],"gloss":"slaying"},{"surface":"காளை","parts":[{"text":"காளை","lemma":"காளை","gloss":"young warrior"}],"gloss":"young warrior"},{"surface":"கூர்த்த","parts":[{"text":"கூர்த்த","lemma":"கூர்","gloss":"sharp"}],"gloss":"sharp"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெந்திறல்","parts":[{"text":"வெம்","lemma":"வெம்மை","gloss":"fierce"},{"text":"திறல்","lemma":"திறல்","gloss":"strength"}],"gloss":"fierce strength"},{"surface":"எஃகம்","parts":[{"text":"எஃகம்","lemma":"எஃகம்","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"spear"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சுவடு","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"chest"},{"text":"வடு","lemma":"வடு","gloss":"scar"}],"gloss":"chest scar"},{"surface":"விளைப்ப","parts":[{"text":"விளைப்ப","lemma":"விளை","gloss":"to cause"}],"gloss":"to cause"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆட்டி","parts":[{"text":"ஆட்டி","lemma":"ஆட்டு","gloss":"brandishing"}],"gloss":"brandishing"},{"surface":"காணிய","parts":[{"text":"காணிய","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"to see"}],"gloss":"to see"},{"surface":"வருமே","parts":[{"text":"வரும்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"comes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he comes indeed"},{"surface":"நெருநை","parts":[{"text":"நெருநை","lemma":"நெருநை","gloss":"yesterday"}],"gloss":"yesterday"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உரைசால்","parts":[{"text":"உரை","lemma":"உரை","gloss":"praise"},{"text":"சால்","lemma":"சால்","gloss":"abundant"}],"gloss":"praise-worthy"},{"surface":"சிறப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"சிறப்பு","lemma":"சிறப்பு","gloss":"excellence"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of excellence"},{"surface":"வேந்தர்","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தர்","lemma":"வேந்தர்","gloss":"kings"}],"gloss":"kings"},{"surface":"முன்னர்","parts":[{"text":"முன்னர்","lemma":"முன்னர்","gloss":"before"}],"gloss":"before"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கரைபொரு","parts":[{"text":"கரை","lemma":"கரை","gloss":"shore"},{"text":"பொரு","lemma":"பொரு","gloss":"beating against"}],"gloss":"beating against the shore"},{"surface":"முந்நீர்த்","parts":[{"text":"முந்நீர்த்","lemma":"முந்நீர்த்","gloss":"of the ocean"}],"gloss":"of the ocean","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"திமிலின்","parts":[{"text":"திமில்","lemma":"திமில்","gloss":"boat"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like a boat"},{"surface":"போழ்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"போழ்ந்து","lemma":"போழ்","gloss":"cutting through"}],"gloss":"cutting through"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"their"}],"gloss":"their"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கயந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"கயம்","lemma":"கயம்","gloss":"soft/tender"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"head"}],"gloss":"soft-headed"},{"surface":"மடப்பிடி","parts":[{"text":"மடப்பிடி","lemma":"மடப்பிடி","gloss":"gentle female elephant"}],"gloss":"gentle female elephant","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புலம்ப","parts":[{"text":"புலம்ப","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"to lament"}],"gloss":"to lament"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இலங்கு","parts":[{"text":"இலங்கு","lemma":"இலங்கு","gloss":"shining"}],"gloss":"shining"},{"surface":"மருப்பு","parts":[{"text":"மருப்பு","lemma":"மருப்பு","gloss":"tusk"}],"gloss":"tusk"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"எறிந்த","parts":[{"text":"எறிந்த","lemma":"எறி","gloss":"slayed/threw at"}],"gloss":"who slayed"},{"surface":"எற்கே","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"me"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"dative suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"to me indeed"}]}],"literal":"As if splitting the ground, scooping with its hooves, / on the horse of whirling speed that destroys the courage of enemies, / the young warrior who slays those who mock, with his sharp, / fierce-powered spear, to inflict a wound on my chest, / brandishing it, comes to see me. Yesterday, / in front of the kings of praise-worthy excellence, / like a boat cutting through the shore-beating ocean, cutting through them, / while the soft-headed young female elephants lamented, / to me, who killed the elephants with shining tusks!","translation":"Yesterday, in front of kings of praise-worthy excellence, like a boat cutting through the shore-beating ocean, I cut through the enemy lines and killed their elephants with shining tusks, leaving their soft-headed female mates to lament. Today, to face me, a young warrior comes riding a horse of whirling speed that destroys the courage of enemies, its hooves scooping the earth as if splitting it. Brandishing his sharp, fierce-powered spear, he comes to see me, seeking to wound my chest!","modern":"நிலத்தைப் பிளப்பது போலக் குளம்புகளால் தோண்டி, எதிரிகளின் மன வலிமையைக் குலைக்கும் வேகத்துடன் சுழலும் குதிரையின் மேல் ஏறி, தன்னை இகழ்பவர்களைக் கொல்லும் இளவீரன் ஒருவன் வருகிறான். நேற்று, புகழ்மிக்க அரசர்களின் முன்னிலையில், கரையை மோதும் கடலில் செல்லும் படகு போலப் பகைப்படையைப் பிளந்து சென்று, இளமையான பெண் யானைகள் கதறி அழும் வண்ணம், அவற்றின் துணைகளான ஒளிரும் தந்தங்களை உடைய ஆண் யானைகளைக் கொன்றவன் நான். அப்படிப்பட்ட எனக்கு நேருக்கு நேராக நெஞ்சில் வடுவை உண்டாக்க எண்ணி, அவன் தன் கூர்மையான, வெம்மையான ஆற்றல் கொண்ட வேலை வீசி ஆட்டியபடி என்னைக் காண வருகிறான்!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the tumpai tiṇai (battle/warfare) and the theme kutirai maṟam (the valor of the horse/rider). The speaker is a veteran warrior who performed great deeds in yesterday's battle, slaying the enemy's war elephants. He observes a young, brave enemy warrior riding a swift, powerful horse towards him today. The young warrior is brandishing a sharp spear, eager to challenge the veteran and leave a scar on his chest. The imagery of the horse scooping the earth and the veteran's past deed of cutting through the army like a boat through waves highlights the intense heroism and martial pride of the classical Tamil society. Key words include kutirai (horse, referred to as māṉ), eḥkam (spear), and yāṉai (elephant).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.76],[0.81,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,2.0],[2.0,2.31],[2.5,3.54],[3.59,4.05],[4.05